00:19:54,920 --> 00:20:09,980
 So if apparently this is something new to me, I didn't know this, but yeah, if you put like a dot slash before your path, that's equivalent in routing, it's equivalent to like going to that path, but it gets handled differently by the NGINX config.

345
00:20:09,980 --> 00:20:18,840
